@startuml View Shopping Cart Sequence Diagram

!theme plain
title View Shopping Cart Use Case\n(צפייה בעגלת הקניות)

actor "User\n(משתמש)" as User
participant "Cart Page\n(עמוד עגלה)" as CartPage
participant "Cart Reducer\n(Redux)" as CartReducer
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Card Controller" as CardController
participant "Card Model\n(MongoDB)" as CardModel
participant "Product Model\n(MongoDB)" as ProductModel

User -> CartPage: Navigate to cart page\n(מעבר לעמוד העגלה)
activate CartPage

CartPage -> CartPage: Get userId from auth state\n(קבלת מזהה משתמש ממצב האימות)

CartPage -> CartReducer: dispatch(get_card_products(userId))
activate CartReducer

CartReducer -> API: GET /api/home/card/get-card-products/:userId
activate API

API -> CardController: get_card_products(req, res)
activate CardController

CardController -> CardController: Extract userId from params\n(חילוץ מזהה משתמש מהפרמטרים)

CardController -> CardController: Convert userId to ObjectId\n(המרת מזהה משתמש ל-ObjectId)

CardController -> CardModel: aggregate pipeline to join with products
activate CardModel
note right of CardModel
  Aggregation pipeline:
  1. Match cart items by userId
  2. Lookup products collection
  3. Join cart items with product details
end note

CardModel --> CardController: Cart products with full details\n(מוצרי עגלה עם פרטים מלאים)
deactivate CardModel

CardController -> CardController: Filter out-of-stock products\n(סינון מוצרים שאינם במלאי)

CardController -> CardController: Calculate totals:\n- buy_product_item (available items)\n- outOfStockProduct (unavailable)\n- price (total price)\n- shipping_fee\n(חישוב סיכומים)

CardController --> API: 200 - Cart data with calculations
deactivate CardController

API --> CartReducer: Success response with cart data
deactivate API

CartReducer -> CartReducer: Update cart state:\n- card_products\n- price\n- card_product_count\n- shipping_fee\n- outOfStockProduct\n- buy_product_item\n(עדכון מצב העגלה)

CartReducer --> CartPage: Cart data updated
deactivate CartReducer

CartPage -> CartPage: Render cart items:\n- Available products\n- Out of stock products\n- Price summary\n- Shipping information\n(הצגת פריטי עגלה)

CartPage --> User: Display cart contents\n(הצגת תוכן העגלה)

alt User wants to update quantity
    User -> CartPage: Click quantity +/- buttons\n(לחיצה על כפתורי כמות)
    
    CartPage -> CartReducer: dispatch(quantity_inc/dec(cardId))
    activate CartReducer
    
    CartReducer -> API: PUT /api/home/card/quantity-inc/:card_id\nor PUT /api/home/card/quantity-dec/:card_id
    activate API
    
    API -> CardController: quantity_inc/dec(req, res)
    activate CardController
    
    CardController -> CardModel: findByIdAndUpdate(cardId, {quantity})
    activate CardModel
    CardModel --> CardController: Updated cart item\n(פריט עגלה מעודכן)
    deactivate CardModel
    
    CardController --> API: 200 - Quantity updated
    deactivate CardController
    
    API --> CartReducer: Success response
    deactivate API
    
    CartReducer -> CartReducer: Update cart state\n(עדכון מצב העגלה)
    
    CartReducer --> CartPage: Refresh cart display
    deactivate CartReducer
    
    CartPage --> User: Show updated quantities\n(הצגת כמויות מעודכנות)
end

alt User wants to remove item
    User -> CartPage: Click remove item button\n(לחיצה על כפתור הסרה)
    
    CartPage -> CartReducer: dispatch(delete_card_product(cardId))
    activate CartReducer
    
    CartReducer -> API: DELETE /api/home/card/delete-card-product/:cardId
    activate API
    
    API -> CardController: delete_card_product(req, res)
    activate CardController
    
    CardController -> CardModel: findByIdAndDelete(cardId)
    activate CardModel
    CardModel --> CardController: Item removed\n(פריט הוסר)
    deactivate CardModel
    
    CardController --> API: 200 - Item deleted
    deactivate CardController
    
    API --> CartReducer: Success response
    deactivate API
    
    CartReducer -> CartReducer: Remove item from state\n(הסרת פריט ממצב)
    
    CartReducer --> CartPage: Refresh cart display
    deactivate CartReducer
    
    CartPage --> User: Show updated cart\n(הצגת עגלה מעודכנת)
end

deactivate CartPage

@enduml
